/-!
# The genuine sphere base twist, ideal sheaf, and simple pole

The supporting files construct the base-twist Cartier bundle on the fixed
Riemann sphere, identify its actual holomorphic sections locally with the
existing vanishing ideal sheaf on all chart subopens, and compute the
simple pole of its particular meromorphic section at infinity. The
section identifications are linear over holomorphic functions, commute
with literal restrictions, and agree on overlaps of the original charts.
-/
